<section class="sec-about_kolte_patil" id="sec-about_kolte_patil">
    <div class="sec_ceo">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="aboutceo_txt">
                <h1 class="title1 darkTitle has-animation">About <span>Kolte Patil</span></h1>
                <div class="has-animation"><p>Founded 35+ years ago, incorporated in 1991 and guided by the simple, yet profound, philosophy of &lsquo;Creation, not construction&rsquo;, Kolte-Patil Developers Ltd is one of India&#39;s leading real estate companies with a diversified presence across Pune, Mumbai and Bengaluru. Headquartered in Pune, KPDL is listed on the NSE and BSE (BSE: 532924, NSE: KOLTEPATIL).</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The company has been creating landmarks for 35+ Years and has developed 68 projects since inception, including residential complexes, IT parks, integrated townships and commercial complexes. It has developed and delivered more than 32 million sq. ft. of saleable area and currently has a project portfolio of approximately 37 million sq. ft., comprising ongoing &amp; unsold projects, projects under approval and existing land bank, across Pune, Mumbai and Bengaluru.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Kolte-Patil is a trusted name with an established reputation for high quality standards, design uniqueness and transparency. Headed by a team of visionaries and dynamic leaders, the long-lasting mission of the company is to create spaces which are <em>present-perfect and future-proof</em>, blend well with the surroundings, and exude vitality and aesthetic appeal. Honesty, innovation, excellence, sustainability, value creation, and commitment to timely delivery are the core values of our company, which are perfectly aligned with every sq. ft. we build.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>The Company&rsquo;s long-term bank debt and non-convertible debentures have been rated &lsquo;AA-/Stable&rsquo; by CRISIL, the highest rating accorded by CRISIL to any publicly listed residential real estate player in India.</p>
</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="aboutceo_img">
            <a data-fancybox href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/WIobPA3iyM0" class="ceoVideo">
            </a>
            <img src="https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/about_koltepatil/image/15714105681535702043.jpg" alt="ABOUT KOLTE PATIL" title="ABOUT KOLTE PATIL" class="ceoImg">
            <div class="ceoName">
                <p>Mr. GOPAL SARDA</p>

<p>GROUP CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
